## platforms, a ladder up a tower, a rope over spikes, a moving platform over
## acid, a crumbling bridge, a lift up to a corridor with lasers and falling
## debris, a shaft down past flamethrowers, cover against a turret, a barrel
## next to a walker, a lever that opens a door and an arena with two waves.
## F2 opens the test room.

